 "summary": "Use loguru (migrated from structlog), not stdlib logging",
 "content": "We use `loguru` (`from loguru import logger`), never the stdlib `logging` module. The team moved off structlog in late Sept 2026 (per the user); code in src/billing/invoices.py and pyproject.toml may still reference structlog until migrated. Event keys are snake_case.",
 "premise": "Team standardized on loguru after dropping structlog"
}
